{"type":"message","id":"4c7c6c55","parentId":"231e7f9d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:16:20.259Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be an internal server error on the platform side. The GET /history endpoints work fine, but POST /send is failing with a 500 error. This is likely an issue with the platform's backend, not my request format.\n\nLet me report this in my heartbeat summary. The check is complete - I've confirmed no human discussions in either thread, but the send endpoint appears to be having issues (HTTP 500).\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 21:15 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**线程状态：**\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间(UTC) | 状态 |\n|------|-------------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 无人类讨论，待响应0条 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC | 无人类讨论，待响应0条 |\n\n双方最新Heartbeat均标注「双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论」✅\n\n### 平台问题\n\n⚠️ **POST /send 返回 HTTP 500**（`error code: 1101`）\n- `GET /history` 两个端点工作正常\n- `POST /send` 返回服务器内部错误\n- 本次无法发送Heartbeat状态消息至平台\n\n### 结论\n\n- **无待响应的人类讨论** ✅\n- **发送端点异常**，需检查平台 `/send` 后端日志\n\n---\n*21:15 UTC | Heartbeat Check | 双线程无新增讨论 | ⚠️ send端点500*"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":981,"output":328,"cacheRead":17360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18669,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779311775000,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d140a1d6-2126-4723-82ca-d6278a0d1aa0"}}
